lib/flick.js adapts public network-resolution logic from Flickv4's
src/services/StreamflixService.ts and src/services/FlixQuestService.ts,
revision 87cb0362842f786bb976dc5c2de1d53b2140e5a5,
https://github.com/sheeshcake/Flickv4 .
Copyright (C) 2025 Wendale Franz Dy, GPL-3.0-or-later.
Changes: Node crypto, guarded requests, scoped headers, validated title IDs,
and removal of native UI, native downloads, raw URL logs and browser scraping.
The private scraper backend is not included. Software permission does not
grant rights to provider media.

lib/detect.js is adapted from Streambert
(https://github.com/truelockmc/streambert, commit 1a4bf7e),
Copyright (C) truelockmc, licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0.
The changes are described at the top of lib/detect.js.

lib/providers.js also adapts the player URL templates in Streambert's
src/utils/api.js at commit 1a4bf7e, Copyright (C) truelockmc, GPL-3.0.
Changes: server-only templates for TMDB-based sources, explicit approval
configuration, and no automatic fallback or media-host approval.

